<tr><td><code>llama3.2-vision</code></td><td>11b, 90b</td><td>128K</td><td>Still solid and tool-capable, but a generation older than qwen3-vl</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>llava</code></td><td>7b, 13b, 34b (1.6)</td><td>32K (7/13B), 4K (34B)</td><td>Older but light, good for quick CPU vision experiments</td></tr>
</tbody></table></figure>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading">Embedding models</h3>



