<tr><td><code>embeddinggemma</code></td><td>768 (MRL to 128)</td><td>2K</td><td>622 MB</td><td>Newest on-device embedder (300M, built on Gemma 3). 100+ languages and Matryoshka dims you can truncate to 512/256/128 to shrink the vector store</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>nomic-embed-text</code></td><td>768</td><td>2K</td><td>274 MB</td><td>The long-time default for local RAG; beats <code>text-embedding-3-small</code> on most benchmarks</td></tr>
